Nature, Powers, Functions, and Duties. The Kabataang Barangay as a body corporate shall have
the powers and attributes of a corporation, including the following:
(1) To enter into contracts;
(2) To sue and to be sued;
(3) To acquire, purchase, hold, transfer and dispose of property and to encumber the same;
(4) To adopt a constitution and by-laws for its internal organization and government;
(5) To raise funds by donations, benefits, and other means for their purposes;
(6) To adopt training programs for the development of the youth and to defray the expense for the same; and
(7) To exercise and perform such other powers and functions as are necessary to carry out its purposes.
Except as otherwise provided in this Decree, the KB Pambansang Katipunan shall enjoy autonomy in the
management and expenditures of its funds derived from its projects or operations, donations, and from any
other source. The KB Pambansang Katipunan shall likewise enjoy autonomy in the formulation of its policies,
plans, projects and programs, but the different offices and agencies of the government shall provide it with
expert, technical and any other assistance upon request.
